---
// Quiz figure for go-variables-types-pointers-functions set 02 (s02q4): the two stack frames of the call reset(retries).
// It names the two variables and the value handed over; it does not say what main prints afterwards.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq02a">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 230" role="img" aria-label="Two stack frames for the call reset(retries). The frame of main holds the variable retries with the value 3. The frame of reset holds the parameter c, filled from the call.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq02a-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The call reset(retries), two frames</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh gọi reset(retries), hai frame</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="230" height="150" rx="8" class="qfig-gq02a-frame" />
    <text x="36" y="68" class="qfig-gq02a-t">frame: main</text>
    <text x="36" y="110" class="qfig-gq02a-c">retries</text>
    <rect x="36" y="122" width="100" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq02a-cell" />
    <text x="86" y="151" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq02a-v">3</text>

    <rect x="330" y="44" width="230" height="150" rx="8" class="qfig-gq02a-frame" />
    <text x="346" y="68" class="qfig-gq02a-t">frame: reset</text>
    <text x="346" y="110" class="qfig-gq02a-c">c</text>
    <rect x="346" y="122" width="100" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq02a-cell" />
    <text x="396" y="151" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq02a-v">3</text>

    <line x1="140" x2="340" y1="144" y2="144" class="qfig-gq02a-link" />
    <polygon points="340,144 328,138 328,150" class="qfig-gq02a-head" />
    <text x="240" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq02a-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>argument in</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đối số truyền vào</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="290" y="218" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq02a-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>reset(retries) runs c = 0 inside the second frame</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>reset(retries) chạy c = 0 bên trong frame thứ hai</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq02a { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq02a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq02a text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq02a .qfig-gq02a-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq02a .qfig-gq02a-t { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq02a .qfig-gq02a-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq02a .qfig-gq02a-v { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq02a-frame { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq02a-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq02a-link { stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .qfig-gq02a-head { fill: var(--act-3); }
</style>
